flowchart TD
    P[Popup\naccessible tabs + settings] -->|runtime messages| BG[Background worker / page\nonly backend lane]
    C[Registered content script\nallowlisted domain only] -->|runtime messages| BG
    BG --> GATE{Open tab matches\nenabled site?}
    GATE -->|yes; explicit enable action may bootstrap| WS[Authenticated WebSocket]
    WS -->|all queries + mutations; token in connection_init| GQL[/ext/graphql/]
    GQL --> S[Extension GraphQL schema]
    S --> D[(PostgreSQL)]
    D --> DOM[ext_domains\nper-user allowlist; YouTube default]
    D --> LIVE[ext_live_sessions\ncrash-safe progress]
    D --> SITE[ani_watch_sites\nlearned deep links]
    D --> BLOCK[blocked source cache]
    BG -->|storage.local| CACHE[Cached domains + blocked list]
    CACHE -. local match .-> C
    HOST[HTTP/HTTPS host permission\none-time install grant] -. browser capability .-> BG
    DOM -. full list including paused entries over WS .-> BG
    BG -. register only enabled domains .-> C
    BG -->|authenticated extPing + ping/pong health| P
    C --> V[Video detector\nMutationObserver + URL reattach]
    V --> HB[15s heartbeat\npause / ended merge]
    HB --> LIVE
    BOOT[Backend startup] --> SWEEP[Live-session sweep]
    SWEEP --> LIVE
    SWEEP --> CURSOR[Durable anime cursor]

    classDef core fill:#18181b,stroke:#a1a1aa,color:#fafafa;
    classDef data fill:#27272a,stroke:#34d399,color:#fafafa;
    classDef privacy fill:#3f3f46,stroke:#d4d4d8,color:#fafafa;
    class P,C,BG,GATE,WS,GQL,S,V,HB,BOOT,SWEEP,CURSOR,HOST core;
    class D,DOM,LIVE,SITE,BLOCK data;
    class CACHE privacy;
